{"sha": "dc20d926cfe7b91643ddfcba7d54db8e0fcd01cb9534475c5c84517d67ad9bd8", "body": ["\\begin{definition}[低共熔点]\\label{def:b2:solid-liquid-diagrams:eutectic}", "二元系统的\\emph{低共熔点}\\index{低共熔点}是", "液体同时与两种固体处于平衡的点；它是", "相图中该部分液体能存在的最低温度。", "低共熔组成的液体，以及它凝固所成的两种固体的细密混合物，", "统称为", "\\emph{低共熔混合物}\\index{低共熔混合物}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{corollary}[低共熔点即两支液相线的交点]\\label{cor:b2:solid-liquid-diagrams:eutectic}", "对固相中不互溶、液相为理想溶液的两个组分，", "低共熔温度 $T_E$ 及组成为", "$x_A(T_E) + x_B(T_E) = 1$ 的解，每个 $x$ 由其对应固相的", "施罗德--范拉尔方程给出。", "\\end{corollary}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在低共熔点处，液相同时被两种固体饱和：", "它同时位于两条分支上，从 A 与从 B 读出的组成相同。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omphase, width=0.62\\linewidth, height=6.5cm, ymin=-25, ymax=85,", "  xlabel={$x$（萘）}, ylabel={$T$（\\unit{\\degreeCelsius}）}]", "\\addplot[omliquidus] table[x=x, y=T] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-solid-liquid-b-benzene.dat};", "\\addplot[omliquidus] table[x=x, y=T] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-solid-liquid-b-naphthalene.dat};", "\\draw[thick] (axis cs:0,-3.55) -- (axis cs:1,-3.55);", "\\fill (axis cs:0.133,-3.55) circle (1.5pt);", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (axis cs:0.133,-4.5) {E};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:0.45,72) {液体};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, align=center] at (axis cs:0.65,22) {液体 + 固态\\\\ 萘};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:0.08,45) {液体 + 固态苯};", "\\draw[thin] (axis cs:0.12,45) -- (axis cs:0.06,0.8);", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:0.55,-15) {固态苯 + 固态萘};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 苯--萘，由各固相的施罗德--范拉尔", "方程计算。两支曲线在低共熔点 E 处相交，", "\\qty{-3.5}{\\degreeCelsius}、萘组成 0.13，其下全部为固体。}", "% ledger: tfus:benzene, dfus:benzene, tfus:naphthalene, dfus:naphthalene", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[苯--萘混合物的冷却]\\label{ex:b2:solid-liquid-diagrams:naphthalene}", "萘的摩尔分数为 0.5 的液体冷却，直至", "液相线萘分支上约 \\qty{46}{\\degreeCelsius} 处，纯固态萘", "开始结晶。液体失去萘，沿分支下降；", "在 \\qty{-3.5}{\\degreeCelsius} 处到达低共熔点，其余部分", "于恒温下凝固为低共熔混合物。由杠杆规则，", "刚高于低共熔点时，固态萘的物质的量分数为 $(0.5 - 0.133)/(1 - 0.133) =", "42~\\%$，低共熔液体为 58~\\%。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[低共熔平台的长度]\\label{prop:b2:solid-liquid-diagrams:plateau-length}", "质量相同的样品以相同的散热速率冷却时，", "低共熔平台的时长正比于到达低共熔点的液体量，", "在低共熔组成时最大，对", "纯组分则为零。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "平台上温度恒定：移去的热量 $\\Phi\\,\\Delta t$", "（速率 $\\Phi$ 恒定），等于低共熔液体凝固放出的热量", "$m_E\\,\\Delta_{\\text{fus}}h_E$。于是 $\\Delta t = m_E\\,\\Delta_{\\text{fus}}h_E/", "\\Phi$，即正比于低共熔液体的质量 $m_E$，", "由杠杆规则给出。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{部分互溶与确定化合物}", "", "多数金属对在固态下既非完全互溶，", "也非完全不互溶：每种金属都能溶入少量另一种。铅最多可溶入", "19~\\% 的锡（按质量计），锡最多溶入 3.4~\\% 的铅。此时相图中有两个固溶体", "(Pb) 与 (Sn)，以及二者之间的低共熔点；低共熔线不再", "延伸到相图两侧，而止于固溶体的", "极限处。", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=0.075cm, y=0.022cm]", "  \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (106,0) node[right] {\\% Sn（质量分数）};", "  \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,360) node[above] {$T$（\\unit{\\degreeCelsius}）};", "  \\foreach \\t in {100,200,300} \\draw (0,\\t) -- (-1.5,\\t) node[left, font=\\scriptsize] {\\t};", "  \\foreach \\w in {0,20,40,60,80,100} \\draw (\\w,0) -- (\\w,-5) node[below, font=\\scriptsize] {\\w};", "  % invariant points (NIST): Pb 327.5, Sn 231.9, eutectic 182.2 at 62.13; limits 18.91 and 96.59", "  \\draw[omliquidus] (0,327.5) .. controls (25,290) and (45,235) .. (62.13,182.2);", "  \\draw[omliquidus] (100,231.9) .. controls (85,215) and (72,200) .. (62.13,182.2);", "  \\draw[omsolidus] (0,327.5) .. controls (8,280) and (14,220) .. (18.91,182.2);", "  \\draw[omsolidus] (100,231.9) .. controls (98.5,215) and (97.5,200) .. (96.59,182.2);", "  \\draw[thick] (18.91,182.2) -- (96.59,182.2);", "  \\draw[omsolidus, densely dashed] (18.91,182.2) .. controls (12,120) and (6,60) .. (3,20);", "  \\draw[omsolidus, densely dashed] (96.59,182.2) .. controls (98.5,120) and (99.3,60) .. (99.6,20);", "  \\fill (62.13,182.2) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill (18.91,182.2) circle (1.2pt); \\fill (96.59,182.2) circle (1.2pt);", "  \\node[anchor=south, font=\\scriptsize] at (62.13,186) {E};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (55,300) {液体};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (6,150) {(Pb)};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (103,140) {(Sn)};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (28,235) {L + (Pb)};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (84,192) {L + (Sn)};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (55,100) {(Pb) + (Sn)};", "  % cooling path at 40 %", "  \\draw[->, omProp, thick] (40,340) -- (40,30);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omProp, anchor=south] at (40,342) {40~\\%};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north east] at (16.6,179) {18.9};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (62.13,178) {62.1};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north east] at (95.8,178) {96.6};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (101,182.2) {\\qty{182.2}{\\degreeCelsius}};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}